as/33b474e4d22ccf2bb2f7732897d8634d.poster.avif?t=1747962491\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878770/extras/33b474e4d22ccf2bb2f7732897d8634d.webm?t=1747962491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878770/extras/33b474e4d22ccf2bb2f7732897d8634d.mp4?t=1747962491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Controls.</strong> There are three ways to control the game:<br><br><i>Keyboard.</i> Arrows \u2014 move. Spacebar\u00a0\u2014 shoot/throw. Enter\u00a0\u2014 select. Esc\u00a0\u2014 open menu.<br><br><i>Gamepad.</i> D-pad\u00a0\u2014 move. A\u00a0\u2014 shoot/throw. B\u00a0\u2014 select. X\u00a0\u2014 menu. You can also move using joysticks and use the right bumper to shoot/throw.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878770/extras/f23be51e09c4946a5b3b10cc459c1bf9.poster.avif?t=1747962491\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878770/extras/f23be51e09c4946a5b3b10cc459c1bf9.webm?t=1747962491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878770/extras/f23be51e09c4946a5b3b10cc459c1bf9.mp4?t=1747962491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i>Mouse.</i> Move the mouse pointer to select the direction. Left-click to move. Right-click to shoot/throw.<br><br><i>Tips and Tricks</i><br><br><i>Hearts and lives.</i> Extra lives save you when you fall into a trap. The trap is permanently disabled after that and you can safely step on that cell.<br>At the start of each level you get one life. On some levels, you can find hearts that give you extra lives.<br>Extra lives don\u2019t save you from bugs, laser and drowning. If you die of any of these reasons, you\u2019ll have to start the level over again no